WEBVTT

00:00:10.306 --> 00:00:12.960
[Stoick] I can almost
smell them.

00:00:13.134 --> 00:00:14.788
They're close.

00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:17.138
Steady.

00:00:27.845 --> 00:00:29.194
Take us in.

00:00:29.368 --> 00:00:32.328
Hard to port.
For Helheim's Gate.

00:00:32.502 --> 00:00:34.286
[man] Hard to port!

00:00:38.116 --> 00:00:40.031
[Stoick] Steady!

00:00:49.997 --> 00:00:51.651
[roaring]

00:00:51.825 --> 00:00:54.219
Hey, you know,
I just happened to notice

00:00:54.393 --> 00:00:56.308
the book had nothing
on Night Furies.

00:00:56.482 --> 00:00:58.876
Is there another book,
or a sequel?

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:01.226
Maybe
a Night Fury pamphlet?

00:01:02.445 --> 00:01:05.273
[Gobber] Focus, Hiccup!
You're not even trying!

00:01:07.319 --> 00:01:10.583
- Today it's all about attack!
- [roars]

00:01:10.757 --> 00:01:13.107
Nadders are quick
and light on their feet.

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:16.372
Your job is to be quicker
and lighter!

00:01:18.852 --> 00:01:20.898
I'm really beginning
to question your
teaching methods!

00:01:21.072 --> 00:01:23.727
Look for its blind spot!
Every dragon has one.

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:26.294
Find it, hide in it
and strike!

00:01:26.469 --> 00:01:27.861
- [snarls]
- [groans] Ohh!

00:01:28.035 --> 00:01:29.950
[Ruffnut]
Do you ever bathe?

00:01:30.124 --> 00:01:32.257
If you don't like it,
then just get
your own blind spot.

00:01:32.431 --> 00:01:35.260
- How about I give you one?
- [Nadder growls]

00:01:36.435 --> 00:01:39.307
Blind spot, yes.
Deaf spot, not so much.

00:01:39.482 --> 00:01:43.311
- [chuckles]
- How would one sneak up
on a Night Fury?

00:01:43.486 --> 00:01:46.967
No one's ever met one
and lived to tell the tale.
Get in there!

00:01:47.141 --> 00:01:49.187
- I know, I know,
but hypothetically...
- [Astrid] Hiccup!

00:01:49.361 --> 00:01:50.884
Get down.

00:01:51.929 --> 00:01:53.713
[growling]

00:01:59.371 --> 00:02:00.459
[growls]

00:02:03.027 --> 00:02:04.463
[roars]

00:02:04.637 --> 00:02:06.247
Watch out, babe.
I'll take care of this.

00:02:08.511 --> 00:02:11.122
- The sun was in
my eyes, Astrid.
- [Nadder roars]

00:02:11.296 --> 00:02:13.167
What do you want me
to do, block the sun?

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:15.082
I could do that
but I don't have time!

00:02:15.256 --> 00:02:17.215
[Snotlout] They probably...

00:02:17.389 --> 00:02:21.132
...take the daytime off,
right? Like a cat.

00:02:21.306 --> 00:02:23.743
Has anyone
ever seen one napping?

00:02:23.917 --> 00:02:25.266
Hiccup!

00:02:26.572 --> 00:02:28.008
Hiccup!

00:02:30.141 --> 00:02:32.404
Ooh! Love
on the battlefield.

00:02:32.578 --> 00:02:34.232
[Ruffnut]
She could do better.

00:02:34.406 --> 00:02:36.277
Let me... Why don't you...?
Aaah!

00:02:38.454 --> 00:02:40.194
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:02:44.982 --> 00:02:47.027
- [panting]
- [Gobber] Well done, Astrid.

00:02:48.246 --> 00:02:51.510
Is this some kind
of a joke to you?

00:02:51.684 --> 00:02:54.731
Our parents' war
is about to become ours.

00:02:54.905 --> 00:02:56.515
Figure out
which side you're on.

00:03:38.383 --> 00:03:39.471
[gasps]

00:03:42.996 --> 00:03:45.172
[sniffs, growls]

00:03:50.047 --> 00:03:51.527
[growls]

00:03:57.184 --> 00:03:58.534
[snarls]

00:04:03.408 --> 00:04:04.931
[snarls]

00:04:06.367 --> 00:04:07.368
[splash]

00:04:13.157 --> 00:04:15.376
[low growl]

00:04:18.075 --> 00:04:20.207
[chuckles] Toothless.

00:04:20.381 --> 00:04:22.470
I could have sworn
you had...

00:04:22.645 --> 00:04:24.168
[gasps]

00:04:25.996 --> 00:04:27.171
...teeth.

00:04:28.955 --> 00:04:30.914
Uh... [stammers]

00:04:31.088 --> 00:04:32.393
No, no, no.

00:04:34.352 --> 00:04:35.483
I... I don't have any more!

00:04:38.138 --> 00:04:39.444
[sucking wind]

00:04:41.533 --> 00:04:43.056
Ugh!

00:05:02.119 --> 00:05:03.511
[sighs]

00:05:05.339 --> 00:05:06.427
Uh...

00:05:08.473 --> 00:05:10.431
- Mmm!
- [low growl]

00:05:11.215 --> 00:05:12.433
Mm-hmm.

00:05:13.652 --> 00:05:14.610
[swallows]

00:05:16.089 --> 00:05:17.047
[moans]

00:05:18.526 --> 00:05:20.180
[swallows, retches]

00:05:20.354 --> 00:05:22.618
[gulps, shudders]

00:05:23.793 --> 00:05:25.098
[slurps, smacks lips]

00:05:25.272 --> 00:05:27.405
[sighs]

00:05:31.104 --> 00:05:33.237
[guttural grunts]

00:05:40.157 --> 00:05:41.593
[snarls]

00:05:41.767 --> 00:05:43.464
[roars]

00:05:56.173 --> 00:05:58.349
[chirping]

00:06:03.136 --> 00:06:04.660
[low growl]

00:06:35.168 --> 00:06:37.170
[purring growl]

00:06:42.698 --> 00:06:44.351
[low growl]

00:06:52.882 --> 00:06:54.710
[tree branch snapping]

00:06:54.884 --> 00:06:57.669
[growls, snarls]

